OL,3,GNEWSAFootball coach charged over
OL,4,Aallegedly breaking ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been accused of coaching a
OL,7,Fyouth football team despite being
OL,8,Fbanned from working with children.
OL,10,FCourtney Branagan, 37, from Hull, has
OL,11,Fbeen charged with engaging in regulated
OL,12,Factivity with children whilst being on
OL,13,Fthe Children's Barred List, Humberside
OL,14,FPolice said.
OL,16,FThe force said Branagan allegedly
OL,17,Fcontinued to coach for two years after
OL,18,Fbeing told he was prohibited by the
OL,19,FDisclosure and Barring Service in 2019.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
